[00:19.880]All my friends have gone away
{"所有朋友都已离我远去"}
[00:23.220]I need myself to sing this song
{"我需要独自唱这首歌"}
[00:27.700]But you always passed away
{"但你总是悄然逝去"}
[00:31.590]But It seems to be o.k.
{"但似乎一切还好"}
[00:35.550]All my wish and powers
{"我所有的愿望与力量"}
[00:39.200]They would take me to the gate
{"它们会引领我至那扇门"}
[00:43.800]Should I really find my problem ?
{"我是否该直面自己的问题？"}
[00:47.200]Do I really want to know about ?
{"我真的想要知道答案吗？"}
[00:51.280]I'm writing a letter for me
{"我正在给自己写信"}
[00:55.220]Is there anything I would say ?
{"还有什么话想说出口？"}
[00:58.720]
[01:01.770]I don't have to throw my life away
{"我不该就此虚度人生"}
[01:09.480]Everything goes wrong to turn into the way of life
{"所有坎坷终将铸就生命之路"}
[01:17.560]This could take so long to find the way
{"寻路之旅或许漫长"}
[01:25.330]All those people cry in vain
{"众人徒然哭泣"}
[01:29.700]Now I see the light in pain
{"如今我在痛苦中看见曙光"}
[01:33.270]I can find the way of love
{"我能寻得爱的方向"}
[01:37.300]
[02:30.010]You don't have to throw your life away
{"你不该就此虚度人生"}
[02:37.460]Everything goes wrong to turn into the way of life
{"所有坎坷终将铸就生命之路"}
[02:45.480]This could take so long to find the way
{"寻路之旅或许漫长"}
[02:53.390]All those people cry in vain
{"众人徒然哭泣"}
[02:57.700]Now you see the light in pain
{"如今你在痛苦中看见曙光"}
[03:00.760]
[03:20.040]Say good bye into the perfect sky
{"向着完美天空道别"}
[03:26.300]But it's your love can be the real life line
{"唯有你的爱才是真正的生命线"}
